sequenceDiagram
    participant Y as You
    participant A as Deep agent
    participant S as State (virtual FS)
    Y->>S: seed /notes/todo.md via files=
    Y->>A: "list files, read todo.md, append a line"
    A->>S: ls
    S-->>A: /notes/todo.md, /notes/ideas.md
    A->>S: read_file /notes/todo.md
    S-->>A: contents
    A->>S: edit_file — append the new line
    A-->>Y: one-sentence confirmation
    S-->>Y: result["files"] with the updated content
